# The Rust CLI's build output. Everything under it is regenerated by
# `cargo build`, including a whole unpacked copy of the crate under
# `target/package/` — which git will happily track as thousands of files
# if nothing says otherwise. Cargo.lock IS committed: a binary crate
# pins its dependency tree so a build here and a build in CI are the
# same build.
crate/target/

